------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIT

GRIDFILE
0 1 /

DX
20*5 /
DY
20*100 /
DZ
20*5 /
TOPS
1*2000.0 /
PORO
20*0.3 /
PERMX
20*2000 /
PERMY
20*2000 /
PERMZ
20*2000 /

